{"_createdAt":"2026-04-26T10:45:04Z","_id":"image-35341fbe19186c5e23f49c132eca6e55c07b585c-896x1195-jpg","_rev":"41QVzCE65xHX8XlHuzLuuY","_type":"sanity.imageAsset","_updatedAt":"2026-04-26T10:45:04Z","assetId":"35341fbe19186c5e23f49c132eca6e55c07b585c","extension":"jpg","metadata":{"_type":"sanity.imageMetadata","blurHash":"dfJb25M{~qIU%MWBRjofWBWBRjt7ayWBayj[ayj[Rjay","dimensions":{"_type":"sanity.imageDimensions","aspectRatio":0.7497907949790795,"height":1195,"width":896},"hasAlpha":false,"isOpaque":true,"lqip":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","palette":{"_type":"sanity.imagePalette","darkMuted":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#40403f","foreground":"#fff","population":3.66,"title":"#fff"},"darkVibrant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#424242","foreground":"#fff","population":0,"title":"#fff"},"dominant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#bcbcbc","foreground":"#000","population":6.51,"title":"#fff"},"lightMuted":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#bcbcbc","foreground":"#000","population":6.51,"title":"#fff"},"lightVibrant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#bcbcbc","foreground":"#000","population":0,"title":"#fff"},"muted":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#737373","foreground":"#fff","population":6.04,"title":"#fff"},"vibrant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#7f7f7f","foreground":"#fff","population":0,"title":"#fff"}},"thumbHash":"JQgSBQD3VXqGiHd4d4iHiIKAfQl3"},"mimeType":"image/jpeg","originalFilename":"WhatsApp Image 2026-03-19 at 7.26.55 AM.jpeg","path":"images/eifjj9rh/production/35341fbe19186c5e23f49c132eca6e55c07b585c-896x1195.jpg","sha1hash":"35341fbe19186c5e23f49c132eca6e55c07b585c","size":102208,"uploadId":"W1FioA769e6BBxvuSZOyCQeC8rSTlu7d","url":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/eifjj9rh/production/35341fbe19186c5e23f49c132eca6e55c07b585c-896x1195.jpg"}
{"_createdAt":"2026-04-26T10:40:52Z","_id":"1317b5a1-0867-4793-8545-79baf87d4567","_rev":"fOwcY0643jaGejaROdu3vS","_type":"story","_updatedAt":"2026-04-26T11:06:48Z","author":{"_ref":"96563951-d829-4b26-b9ba-ba93306ab8ad","_type":"reference"},"body":[{"_key":"6150a1fd06a0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"4c8c470db1db","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"In an era of music often dominated by the superficial, Tzy Panchak and @OfficialRaizy offer a profound spiritual reset with their track, \"God In Me.\" This is not merely a song; it is a sonic meditation on the divine spark that resides within the human spirit, serving as both a shield against the world and a compass for the soul."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ecd0388b939d","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"246bccb3bb52","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"fcbeaa69d7bf","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"2fdec6b2f5e7","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"70b3b8785458","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Refusing to Sell the Soul"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h4"},{"_key":"062df2fabeb3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"bc76efbfe538","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" The song opens with a powerful declaration of integrity. The lyrics speak of a refusal to \"sell my conscience\" or allow external pressures to \"taste my patience\". This sets a foundational theme: the internal world is sacred territory. The artists suggest that the noise of the world is secondary to the \"frequency\" we choose to tune into. In a landscape of vanity, they choose a frequency of medicine—claiming that \"any song this is medicine for the next\"."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b64c38b083a1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"c36e10d24cbf","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"853136536bfc","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"47a922a7c517","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"The Alchemy of Perspective"},{"_key":"263ca6ee100d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h4"},{"_key":"49a6d05ae716","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"6d63e9f48069","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c1b894b4c855","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"be03506b2aae","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Perhaps the deepest insight offered in the song is the transformative power of the divine presence on human perception. The lyrics repeatedly affirm, \"I know there's a god in me where they giving you energy where they make me see enemies a friend in need.\"\n"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"9b0b3b29be65","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"969b9e77649e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"This is a radical act of spiritual alchemy. Instead of meeting hostility with hostility, the \"God within\" provides a new \"energy\" that allows the artist to view a perceived enemy through the lens of compassion, seeing them as a \"friend in need\"."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"7a2b26759612","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"7872edf4017c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ef5a18eb15b7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"4890a51aaff6","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Drowning the Ego"},{"_key":"5ec291a94bd5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h4"},{"_key":"33e9ce395941","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"cf294140809d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The song also serves as a warning against the pitfalls of the human condition. There is a conscious plea to not \"dwell on vanity\" and to not let \"ego follow my head\". The artists acknowledge the vulnerability of the human experience—the feeling of \"drowning\"—and the realization that without this inner connection, one is lost."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"984e4a4be3aa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"50cf58a20043","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b9255b559b7f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"febd19a5f457","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Conclusion: A Prayer for the Journey"},{"_key":"f8bac9b9d76c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h4"},{"_key":"c6e5a1032e49","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"31f7fb1107ca","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"38cc1307a10e","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"23edb842a7b8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\"God In Me\" concludes as a rhythmic prayer, reminding the listener that this divine energy is the source of \"new energy\" needed to navigate life's complexities. Ultimately, Tzy Panchak and @OfficialRaizy have crafted a \"medicine\" for the modern listener—a reminder that the most powerful force we will ever encounter is already dwelling within us."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"category":{"_ref":"cd6f89e3-a1ee-4805-b092-c80ab52c8d76","_type":"reference"},"excerpt":"A sonic meditation on the divine spark within — Tzy Panchak and @OfficialRaizy's \"God In Me\" is a song, a prayer, and a reminder that the most powerful force we will ever encounter is already dwelling within us.","featured":true,"likes":120,"mainImage":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-4cce9cb0b347ae36c78a465e4ffe4fe239b75ab7-999x799-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"publishedAt":"2026-04-26T10:43:00.000Z","readTime":"4MIN","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"the-inner-temple-unpacking-the-divine-resonance-of-god-in-me-by-tzy-panchak"},"title":"The Inner Temple: Unpacking the Divine Resonance of \"God In Me\" by Tzy Panchak ","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/fv9OzFLCZjo?si=OSwdSrSL5T-fgs-V","views":50}
{"_createdAt":"2026-04-26T10:44:45Z","_id":"96563951-d829-4b26-b9ba-ba93306ab8ad","_rev":"41QVzCE65xHX8XlHuzM0sk","_system":{"base":{"id":"96563951-d829-4b26-b9ba-ba93306ab8ad","rev":"fOwcY0643jaGejaROdtcR4"}},"_type":"author","_updatedAt":"2026-04-26T10:52:54Z","avatar":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-35341fbe19186c5e23f49c132eca6e55c07b585c-896x1195-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"bio":"A lover of culture A lover of cultureA lover of culture","name":"Gita","role":"Lead developer and product manager","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"gita"}}
{"_createdAt":"2026-06-26T11:22:31Z","_id":"6db458bd-ebab-4e40-99c0-1fa66f955bb2","_rev":"xoyvHeR9LWL6lxpNWHS1RD","_type":"story","_updatedAt":"2026-06-26T11:22:52Z","author":{"_ref":"55f90d3c-3b9b-4fbf-bb63-0b8c2a2b552e","_type":"reference"},"body":[{"_key":"b1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"c1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The Banso (or Nso) people are a vibrant ethnic group originating from the North West Region of Cameroon. Their culture is deeply rooted in traditional leadership, agriculture, and rich spiritual beliefs. The paramount ruler, known as the Fon, plays a central role in guiding the community and preserving ancestral traditions."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"category":{"_ref":"49d50a5f-0e18-40ab-a3f1-f0dbc236ed55","_type":"reference"},"excerpt":"Explore the rich heritage and traditions of the Banso people of Cameroon.","publishedAt":"2026-06-26T12:00:00Z","readTime":"5 min read","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"banso-culture-heritage-traditions"},"title":"Banso Culture: Heritage and Traditions"}
{"_createdAt":"2026-06-26T11:52:57Z","_id":"image-4b70d38708bf1367531344154cbe3e7d53d96560-1200x1714-jpg","_rev":"hJHhLJbyZKMyFfwQLar1eP","_type":"sanity.imageAsset","_updatedAt":"2026-06-26T11:52:57Z","assetId":"4b70d38708bf1367531344154cbe3e7d53d96560","extension":"jpg","metadata":{"_type":"sanity.imageMetadata","blurHash":"dhOplRt7_Nt7n*WBbHay%#ofIAWBtlWBaKofnOf6Wqay","dimensions":{"_type":"sanity.imageDimensions","aspectRatio":0.7001166861143524,"height":1714,"width":1200},"hasAlpha":false,"isOpaque":true,"lqip":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","palette":{"_type":"sanity.imagePalette","darkMuted":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#502723","foreground":"#fff","population":0.39,"title":"#fff"},"darkVibrant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#d50c0d","foreground":"#fff","population":5.83,"title":"#fff"},"dominant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#d50c0d","foreground":"#fff","population":5.83,"title":"#fff"},"lightMuted":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#dccfba","foreground":"#000","population":0.03,"title":"#000"},"lightVibrant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#fce6e0","foreground":"#000","population":0.57,"title":"#000"},"muted":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#6c9480","foreground":"#fff","population":0,"title":"#fff"},"vibrant":{"_type":"sanity.imagePaletteSwatch","background":"#ee0711","foreground":"#fff","population":0.41,"title":"#fff"}},"thumbHash":"bxgSDQb4R3d3yEiXd4d4iEeJcJMI"},"mimeType":"image/jpeg","originalFilename":"fisherman.jpg","path":"images/eifjj9rh/production/4b70d38708bf1367531344154cbe3e7d53d96560-1200x1714.jpg","sha1hash":"4b70d38708bf1367531344154cbe3e7d53d96560","size":185601,"uploadId":"9bd60d4acc3f123b9fad6fbed169bf4e96dff019","url":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/eifjj9rh/production/4b70d38708bf1367531344154cbe3e7d53d96560-1200x1714.jpg"}
{"_createdAt":"2026-06-26T11:53:32Z","_id":"678350b7-9a13-46b1-86c5-cea5822eb55d","_rev":"67DdE3aKx6xHZlkgkAfi80","_type":"story","_updatedAt":"2026-06-26T11:53:47Z","author":{"_ref":"55f90d3c-3b9b-4fbf-bb63-0b8c2a2b552e","_type":"reference"},"body":[{"_key":"b1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"c1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The Fisherman's Diary is an incredible story of perseverance and ambition. Inspired by the true story of Malala Yousafzai, it follows a 12-year-old girl named Ekah who is determined to go to school in a community where girl-child education is considered a taboo. Despite fierce resistance from her father and traditional structures, she fights bravely for her right to learn. This Cameroonian masterpiece, starring Faith Fidel and Kang Quintus, beautifully captures the struggle and triumph of challenging deeply rooted norms."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"category":{"_ref":"8f0d9748-c579-4328-8911-e162ff25c6f5","_type":"reference"},"excerpt":"Discover the compelling story of a young girl fighting for her right to education in a traditional fishing village in Cameroon.","mainImage":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-4b70d38708bf1367531344154cbe3e7d53d96560-1200x1714-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"publishedAt":"2026-06-26T12:00:00Z","readTime":"8 min read","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"fishermans-diary-masterpiece"},"title":"The Fisherman's Diary: Breaking Barriers in Education"}
{"_createdAt":"2026-06-26T11:57:02Z","_id":"14c2f4ce-2b00-4188-aacc-ca990f23b64e","_rev":"xoyvHeR9LWL6lxpNWHUjmV","_type":"story","_updatedAt":"2026-06-26T12:00:59Z","author":{"_ref":"55f90d3c-3b9b-4fbf-bb63-0b8c2a2b552e","_type":"reference"},"body":[{"_key":"b1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"c1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Half Heaven is an incredible cinematic experience that delves into the realities of ambition, survival, and emotional conflict in urban Cameroon. Follow the intense journey as characters are forced to make life-altering decisions. This highly-anticipated release sets a new standard for local storytelling and visual excellence."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"category":{"_ref":"8f0d9748-c579-4328-8911-e162ff25c6f5","_type":"reference"},"excerpt":"A dramatic story exploring ambition, survival, and emotional conflict in urban Cameroon.","publishedAt":"2026-06-26T13:00:00Z","readTime":"5 min read","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"half-heaven-premiere"},"title":"Half Heaven: The Premiere"}
{"_createdAt":"2026-04-25T05:00:50Z","_id":"c91e936e-066e-44b3-b630-706ec7684cfc","_rev":"0js60YTKjB6SWuvC3fyiE4","_system":{"base":{"id":"c91e936e-066e-44b3-b630-706ec7684cfc","rev":"fOwcY0643jaGejaROdWjzK"}},"_type":"story","_updatedAt":"2026-04-25T09:08:59Z","author":{"_ref":"55f90d3c-3b9b-4fbf-bb63-0b8c2a2b552e","_type":"reference"},"body":[{"_key":"g1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"x1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Sawaflix is thrilled to announce the launch of its brand new community hub — Area Tory. This is your space to share stories, discover cultural gems, and connect with fellow African storytellers from across the continent."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"g2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"x2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Area Tory is more than just a blog — it's a living archive of African heritage, powered by the community. From deep cultural dives to music reviews, cinema spotlights, and tourism guides, every story matters."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"g3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"x3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"This is just the beginning. We're building something special, and we want YOU to be part of it. Stay tuned for creator applications, editorial partnerships, and exclusive community events coming soon."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"category":{"_ref":"4589aa53-9f4f-4694-a04c-4838383ff7b9","_type":"reference"},"excerpt":"The Area Tory community hub is now live! Your space to share and discover African stories, culture, and heritage.","featured":false,"likes":0,"publishedAt":"2025-04-25T05:00:00Z","readTime":"3 min read","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"area-tory-community-hub-is-live"},"title":"Area Tory is officially live — welcome to the community!","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fv9OzFLCZjo\u0026list=RDfv9OzFLCZjo\u0026start_radio=1","views":0}
